title: "Metadata Dataset of Medieval Churches from Central Europe"
type: dataset
version: "1.0"
keywords:
  - middle ages
  - churches
  - austria
  - czechia
  - patron saints
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  This publication contains two final datasets of medieval churches from
  Central Europe for a study of church orientations, astronomical sunrise
  dates, and associated saints. The original church records were pulled
  from the THANADOS database.
